161 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 112 0 R
/E (Since starting at GSU, I've noticed a real gap in how prepared students, especially Black and Latinx students, are for landing internships and new grad roles. ColorStack Nationals changed that for me back in 2025. The resume reviews, career advice, and connections helped me land my internship at FactSet. That experience is why I brought the ColorStack chapter back to campus this year, building a new executive board and launching our chapter website along the way.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
162 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 112 0 R
/E (ColorStack is a cheat code for underrepresented students navigating tech. It's a space for real support, career growth, and community. I'm excited to keep building that here and help others access the same opportunities I did.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
